<title>USA: Ceridian Corp Q4 profit. [corrected 15:00 gmt]</title>
<headline>Ceridian Corp Q4 profit. [corrected 15:00 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline from &quot;Ceridian Corp year-ago q4 diluted shr loss $0.6.&quot;)</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr prim  profit	 $0.65     loss	 $0.65</p>
<p> Shr dil   profit	 $0.61     loss	 $0.65</p>
<p> Net	 profit	49,300     loss	39,700</p>
<p> Revs		     404,100		  361,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	70,928		   66,258</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	81,312		   66,258</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1995 includes about $80.0 million in charges associated with acquisition of Comdata.</p>
